{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-8","kind":"proposition","title":"等比数列中的平方数与立方数","englishTitle":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, the third from the unit will be square, as will also those which successively leave out one; the fourth will be cube, as will also all those which leave out two; and the seventh will be at once cube and square, as will also those which leave out five.","book":9,"number":8,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.8","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.8/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":8,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","contentId":"euclid-9-8","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d6750ef133b0327508eede3fc8309e18edfe3aee26f80ba74a47e83280e7c7a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-8.statement","euclid-9-8.construction.1","euclid-9-8.proof.1","euclid-9-8.proof.2","euclid-9-8.proof.3","euclid-9-8.proof.4","euclid-9-8.proof.5","euclid-9-8.proof.6","euclid-9-8.proof.7","euclid-9-8.proof.8","euclid-9-8.proof.9","euclid-9-8.proof.10","euclid-9-8.proof.11","euclid-9-8.proof.12","euclid-9-8.proof.13","euclid-9-8.conclusion","euclid-9-8.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-8.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c5147fc38d089545b1d316dd0bc9b67871cb50ea88435d422044ac5486ac58e2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, the third from the unit will be square, as will also those which successively leave out one; the fourth will be cube, as will also all those which leave out two; and the seventh will be at once cube and square, as will also those which leave out five."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从单位开始的号码在连比例,单位的第三个数字将是平方数,同样,连续遗漏一个的数字也是平方数;第四个数字将是立方体,所有遗漏两个的数字也是;第七数字将是立方体和平方数,同样,退出五个的数字也是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a91260b4c618f91c9fb230c17dd6f58636f682119a1bf19f3639d28a464b1c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be as many numbers as we please, A, B, C, D, E, F, beginning from an unit and in continued proportion; I say that B, the third from the unit, is square, as are also all those which leave out one; C, the fourth, is cube, as are also all those which leave out two; and F, the seventh, is at once cube and square, as are also all those which leave out five."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们想多少数字就A,B,C,D,E,F,从单位开始,到连比例;我说,单位的第三个数字是平方数,所有漏掉一个的数字也是平方数;第四个数字是立方体,所有漏掉两个的数字也是C;第七组数字是F,立即放出立方体,平方数;所有漏掉五个的数字也是B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9feeb1915b5fe05f7b44aeecb2e05ec3660c46894f16edca231bc55337812498","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as the unit is to A, so is A to B, therefore the unit measures the number A the same number of times that A measures B. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,单位对A的比等于A对B的比,因此,单位对整除的比是A对B的比的两倍,而A是A对B的比的两倍。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e34cdc28a5f9332b4cfbba9d8c571be2727f9ecf4be2d2c2c55885925eb3d676","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit measures the number A according to the units in it; therefore A also measures B according to the units in A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位,整除数字为A数字;因此,根据A,整除,整除,B数字为整除,B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b06a78c8cf49b1d6ff1c27b7df9ee835345f05cb77c70f14db5ba6683bf3fce6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A by multiplying itself has made B; therefore B is square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A乘以本身就达到B;因此,B是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00804fa5c26df3c9c3e9fd2463e3886bb66fabea155cd10c5d5d0bcaa8fb42ec","citations":["euclid-8-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since B, C, D are in continued proportion, and B is square, therefore D is also square. [[VIII. 22](/principles/euclid-8-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B,C,D在连比例,B是平方数,D也是平方数。 [[VIII. 22](/principles/euclid-8-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14cc3b475a58e1bbdf714733f568b13bab600ff2414ec3e52bebae65dc7fb1bc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason F is also square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,F也是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"549be73968bd0137da1ce8f1b72ab69b381d4c1004cd04e0bbe9a437eb8bec2e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that all those which leave out one are square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,所有那些漏掉一个的都是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"199ac1579a97ad6d1df97a7b8ce7ae394c79ad3e66014b635dcf31a37dfd3807","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that C, the fourth from the unit, is cube, as are also all those which leave out two."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我要说,C, 也就是单位的第四, 是立方体, 以及所有那些 排出两个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7561a30f767c9709d9aa7efab59dab4c047a1158375d3f2acfbe181a0deffd43","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as the unit is to A, so is B to C, therefore the unit measures the number A the same number of times that B measures C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,单位对A的比等于B对C的比,因此,单位对整除的比是B对A的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e9f1484a8b4da2db4262b2b5420fa5b4183569dbb2a29578450e1fe6331caff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit measures the number A according to the units in A; therefore B also measures C according to the units in A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据A的单位 整除数字为A数字;因此,根据A的单位数字为B数字为整除 C数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb288356a93c3f0185b4ef1e90a048c4c8100553a118d6c179912947fb355fe6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A by multiplying B has made C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A乘以B, 已经产生了C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c2b577b3f238ab437fc6ef5c6fd1fe42ff1994fd8668dfcdfa40005f1fcb690","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then A by multiplying itself has made B, and by multiplying B has made C, therefore C is cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,A乘以B, B乘以C, 所以C是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ced48d05393909d7e63a650128158f6e3b7bacb054686159b78f3fd6ce67ed8","citations":["euclid-8-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since C, D, E, F are in continued proportion, and C is cube, therefore F is also cube. [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C,D,E,F是连比例,C是立方体, 所以F也是立方体。 [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37daebf29c54901f41bae66a0bb1815b7fca0699ba5f894d443b2fc585c909e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved square; therefore the seventh from the unit is both cube and square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也证明了平方数,单位的第七位是立方体和平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d995df132b9f421a3fa4caf439c142c223987c01879235a84b7533963cdb9ca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that all the numbers which leave out five are also both cube and square. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,所有排除5个数字的数值都是立方体和平方数。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-8.source","contentId":"euclid-9-8","revisionId":"euclid-9-8@raw-3d6750ef133b0327","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13f4d36113908bcd6bf46ef15ece2425fea797267ce7590390b924e0328f0a9e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.8/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.8\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-8:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-8.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-8:euclid-8-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-8.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-8:euclid-8-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-8.proof.12"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 23"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-9:euclid-9-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-9.proof.1","euclid-9-9.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"IX. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-9-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-10.proof.2","euclid-9-10.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"IX. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-12:euclid-9-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-12.proof.11"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"IX. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-13:euclid-9-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-13.proof.33"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"IX. 8"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-8:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","id":"euclid-7-def-20","book":7,"number":20,"kind":"definition","title":"成比例的整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-8:euclid-8-22:explicit","id":"euclid-8-22","book":8,"number":22,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与平方与比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-8:euclid-8-23:explicit","id":"euclid-8-23","book":8,"number":23,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与立方与比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-9:euclid-9-8:explicit","id":"euclid-9-9","book":9,"number":9,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与平方与立方","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-9-8:explicit","id":"euclid-9-10","book":9,"number":10,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与平方与立方","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-12:euclid-9-8:explicit","id":"euclid-9-12","book":9,"number":12,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与连比例与比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-13:euclid-9-8:explicit","id":"euclid-9-13","book":9,"number":13,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
